WEBVTT

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.900
Mom... Mom!

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.320
Mizuki! Mizuki!

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.190
Dad!

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.920
Is... Is Mom okay?!

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.710
I only just heard, and I came as soon as I could.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.640
Mizuki...

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:27.790
Mom...

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.450
Grandma!

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:32.550
Is Mom okay?!

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.740
You said she was brought in after taking a turn for the worse?

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:36.800
Darling.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.820
Should you... Are you okay?

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:42.650
I'm fine.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.680
Fine? Then...

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.670
It's good news, actually.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.570
I'm pregnant.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.530
Oh, you're pregnant!

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:52.610
Oh, you're just pregna—

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.160
Whaaaaaaaaat?!

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:05.290
Really?

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.500
Is it a girl?! A boy?! Which is it?!

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.580
I don't know, but Tsubomi, 
you're going to be their big sister!

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.260
Me...

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:18.280
Their big sister...

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.180
HeartCatch

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:23.640
Precure!

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.230
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:30.190
Now, all together

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.700
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:43.330
Within each of our chests,

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.000
they begin to sprout

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:47.670
The seeds of the heart

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:48.920
are growing

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:51.540
bit by bit

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.210
Red,

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:52.830
white

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.130
and yellow

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.880
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:58.340
all varied colors

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.820
that they

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.970
shine so brightly!

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:07.310
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.810
with such care

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.530
will never wither

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.110
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.990
Now, all together

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.450
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.120
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:29.000
They're always right by our sides

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:29.830
So together

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:33.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.630
bloom even more!

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.180
HeartCatch

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:39.690
Precure!

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:52.440
Tsubomi!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:55.410
Why'd you dash off like that? We were worried.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.080
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.110
But the thing is... {oh gosh, their eyes.....}

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.820
My mom's pregnant!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.060
That's a surprise!{the "medetai" here meaning good news...}

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:03.200
Yeah.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.830
I've got super-eyes!{...is punned into "me dekai" here meaning 'big eyes'.}

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.750
Your puns are worse than ever, Dad!

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:14.340
So anyway, she's going to stay with Tsubomi's grandma for a while.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:17.130
I keep telling him I'll be fine here.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.960
I mean, we have the shop to consider.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.840
No way! You need to take it easy now!

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.350
I'll help look after the shop, don't worry!

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:25.860
I do worry, though.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:28.400
I'm in middle school now, Mom! I can handle it!

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:31.080
Put a little faith in Tsubomi, okay?

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.230
All right. Do me proud, Tsubomi.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.030
Have a safe trip!

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:42.200
It's Sunday tomorrow.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.910
I've gotta give it my all!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:52.460
Our Family's Growing<i>!</i>

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:52.460
Our Family's Growing<i>!</i>

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.750
Here goes!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.810
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.940
Don't get yourself all flustered, dear.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:19.400
Oh, you made breakfast this morning, Tsubomi?

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:21.400
Oooh!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.150
This looks great!

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.660
I like them a little charred.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.910
Tsubomi cooked the rice too.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:33.130
Some nice and fluffy rice is just what I wanted!

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:33.950
Let's see!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.750
Delicious!

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:42.510
Thanks for the food!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.510
I'll be off, then!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.760
Bye, dear.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.890
Bye, Dad!

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.160
Right, I'd better get moving as well.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.270
Okay!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:04:59.770
Oh?

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.550
It appears we have some guests.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:04.700
You guys!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.640
Let us help too!

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:09.030
Being a florist sounds like it'd be fun!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.750
I'd love you to!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.730
Do you clean out here every day?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:41.680
Yes.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:48.420
The flowers drop petals and leaves, and soil always ends up all over, so the mess piles up very quickly.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:51.910
We're cleaning too!

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.120
We're helping! {of course you are}

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.560
You want these lined up in front of the shop?

00:05:58.560 --> 00:05:59.990
I'll help too!

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:01.090
All right, thanks.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:06.860
Being a florist is hard work, huh?

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:12.470
It is, but my mom always told me, if you love flowers, no other job can even compare.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.390
And I totally agree!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:19.770
It warms my heart to see our flowers 
bring happiness and smiles to people.

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:26.860
We'd better open up shop.

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:28.140
Okay!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:45.210
If one clears the mind, even fire
 itself can be made to cool the body.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:48.430
By freeing my mind of worldly thoughts,

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.720
I can rid myself of the very sensation of pain.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.920
I will free my mind.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:13.910
I will empty my heart and cleave 
through their HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:18.900
Precure! Today, our long feud comes to an end!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:24.080
If you want flowers for your girlfriend, you've gotta go with white cyclamens!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.710
They represent purity.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:26.880
Okay...

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.300
So give her a card that says what they mean along with them!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.340
What kind of flowers are you looking for?

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.520
What flowers do you like?

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:35.760
Me? Um...

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.290
Because it's you I want to give them to!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.800
We're so daring!

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:41.600
Sure are.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:48.940
If you want to commemorate a new construction,
 may I recommend long-lasting preserved flowers?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.570
That does sound good.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.550
Yuri's amazing!

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:53.480
Tsubomi!

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:55.990
Can you give me a hand?

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:04.210
I was always happy to do all the heavy lifting, but Mizuki was always pushing herself.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:09.180
She'd overwork herself, and I'd always be worrying over her.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:11.670
Dad.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:15.780
You're both still really in love, aren't you?

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:17.970
Yeah, we really are!

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:22.060
But it's not just her I love.

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.970
It's you and your grandmother too.

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:28.320
Being surrounded by my family is what keeps me going.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.410
Tsubomi!

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:37.360
There's a customer here who wants a wedding bouquet.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.480
What should we do?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.910
Mom always did the bouquets.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:46.230
Well, you used to help her with them, didn't you? Go on.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.380
Okay then!

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.000
Welcome!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:54.470
I'm certain we'll be able to create a bouquet that meets your needs.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:58.560
Could you tell me a little about the happy couple?

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:24.040
That bouquet giving you trouble?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:27.750
I don't know what flowers to
 use or what design to go with.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.590
I'm at a total loss!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:32.760
Why not ask your mother for advice?

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:38.870
Okay!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:45.600
<i>Their parents had been against them getting
 married up until now, so they never actually wed.</i>

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:50.070
<i>But they have two children together, and their parents finally gave their blessing.</i>

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.210
<i>So they're finally getting married.</i>

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:55.360
So their children will be part of their wedding, then?

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.200
<i>I can't think of a greater happiness.</i>

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.500
Yeah, you're right!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:03.630
It's a celebration for their whole family, not just for the two of them!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.310
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:12.340
Their eldest daughter, Kasumi, 
seemed kinda sad about it, though.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.310
I see...

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:19.360
So you're wondering what kind of 
bouquet you should make for them?

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.560
<i>Yes.</i>

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.300
<i>What do you think, Mom?</i>

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:27.670
It's not just about the happy couple, but Kasumi as well.

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:31.770
I think their bouquet needs to bring happiness to their entire family.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:36.610
<i>I know you can do it, Tsubomi.</i>

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:43.370
What's important is that you pour your 
own feelings into creating their bouquet.

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:45.870
Thanks, Mom!

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.540
<i>I'll call again if anything else comes up.</i>

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:52.290
Good luck, Tsubomi!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.090
Dad!

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:59.620
Can we go and talk to Kasumi about the bouquet?

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:03.600
Say, Dad.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:08.200
Can you tell me about when I was born?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.310
Sure.

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:13.520
The day you were born, it had rained the whole day.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.650
You were there crying your eyes out,

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:24.490
but your mother and I, and all the rest of the family, were overcome with joy.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:32.210
When the rain finally stopped, we saw the sunlight reflecting off the budding trees outside the window.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:40.050
Your mother said that soon, those buds would become beautiful flowers.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:44.550
And those flowers will bring joy to everyone.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:48.350
Hence your name, Tsubomi. It means "buds."

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:51.810
So that's why you named me Tsubomi.

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:55.690
We'll have to think of a good
 name for your new sibling too!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.350
Yeah!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:01.480
"I have arrived, my princess!"

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:03.510
"Who are you?"

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.700
"I am the prince of the western lands!"

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:07.320
"Hello!"

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:10.080
The flower lady?

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.330
You're playing princesses?

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:13.500
It's a story I came up with!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:17.290
Can we talk for a bit, Kasumi?

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.600
I want to ask about the bouquet.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:20.970
I don't care about the bouquet.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.540
It has nothing to do with me.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.410
Where are your mom and dad, Kasumi?

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.980
Are you playing out here alone?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.390
Mommy and Daddy are busy running the shop.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.740
And even if they're not...

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:42.320
Ever since my little sister was born, she's been all they care about.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.910
They don't even remember I exist.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:46.820
Kasumi,

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:51.450
your mom and dad haven't forgotten about you.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:53.700
I don't think so either.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.040
Oh, I know!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:59.300
Will you help me design their wedding bouquet, Kasumi?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.160
Me?

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:05.440
Yeah! Let's make a bouquet
 that'll make everyone happy!

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:10.060
Your dad, your mom, you, and your little sister!

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:13.850
But it was my little sister...

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.430
that stole my parents from me!

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:18.900
Kasumi!

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:36.370
The Flower of your Heart has weakened nicely.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:36.920
Who're you?!

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:40.880
I am Kumojacky, a commander of the Desert Apostles!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:45.720
I shall take the Flower of your Heart and use it to defeat those meddling Precure!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:50.100
Flower of the Heart, show yourself!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:05.150
You're up, Desertrian!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.200
Kasumi! Where are you?!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:13.970
Kasumi!

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:16.540
A Desertrian?!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.580
Kasumi's Flower of the Heart is the one that was stolen!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.170
Don't worry, Kasumi! I'll save you!

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:35.390
Seed of the Precure, go forth!

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.290
Precure!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.730
Open My Heart!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.540
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.670
Cure Blossom!

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:33.080
My dad...

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:35.660
And my mom!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.910
Don't care about me anymore!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.540
They hate me now!

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:45.200
That's not true!

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.710
No parent would ever hate their child!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.870
Every child is born from their parents' love!

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:06.940
That's why their children bring them happiness!

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.400
Children... bring happiness?

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:12.870
I'm going to have a new brother or sister soon.

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:15.530
And I'm so excited I can hardly wait!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.370
Remember that feeling!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:22.020
I know you were dying to meet your sister too, Kasumi!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:25.130
I wanted... a sister?

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:31.130
I wanted... to meet my sister...

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:35.430
I know you love your sister dearly, don't you, Kasumi?!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.930
Yeah... I do...

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.850
It seems I must take the field.

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:47.280
Sink into the darkness, and let your dark heart control you!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:51.000
Dark Bracelet!

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:02.910
Love and family are pointless concepts!

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:07.420
All that matters is victory and defeat, and on which side you fall!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:13.130
You're just using Kasumi's love for her family as a weapon,

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:17.390
and I've had it up to here with this!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.140
Shut up and fight!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.810
I'll start by destroying you!

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:37.400
Blossom!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:44.300
You came!

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:45.120
Here we go!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:57.680
Your pathetic attacks won't be enough to stop me!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.390
This is revenge for Sasorina!

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.350
Transform into Super Precure!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.030
HeartCatch Mirage!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.940
Come on, everyone!

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:22.550
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:53.190
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:59.140
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.830
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:15.590
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:28.810
I'll show you the results of my training!

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:40.400
If one clears the mind, even fire
 itself can be made to cool the body!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.250
Kasumi.

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:29.910
I'm sorry we've been neglecting you.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:31.720
It's okay.

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:33.750
I'm sorry for being selfish.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:37.920
I'm the big sis around here,
 so I've gotta be strong for her!

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:40.880
I can learn a lot from you!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:43.920
I'm going to be a big sis soon!

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:47.420
So I can look up to you for advice, Kasumi!

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:55.900
I know!

00:20:56.430 --> 00:21:00.360
Miss Tsubomi, let me help make the bouquet too!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:01.530
Sure!

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.360
We'll make it together!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.630
In the language of flowers, 
a convallaria means "blessed tidings."

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:10.660
It looks like Kasumi's family has a 
lot of happiness to look forward to!

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.200
Yeah, I think so too!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.620
And Tsubomi's does too!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:19.710
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:33.950
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:39.810
That's a beautiful bouquet, Tsubomi!

